Use /usr/bin/env bash in build-time tool scripts.

all_errnos and all_syscalls run during the meson build (generate
errnos.h / syscalls.h). Hardcoded /bin/bash breaks on hosts without
it (e.g. NixOS build machines).

--- a/tools/all_errnos
+++ b/tools/all_errnos
@@ -1 +1 @@
-#!/bin/bash
+#!/usr/bin/env bash
--- a/tools/all_syscalls
+++ b/tools/all_syscalls
@@ -1 +1 @@
-#!/bin/bash
+#!/usr/bin/env bash
